[14.925,"o","\r\nI moved \"Renew passport\" back one week, from Dec 1 to Dec 8, 2026 at 16:30 UTC. I changed both the d\r\nue date and the reminder time, which were the same.\r\n\r\nThe reminder also has an all-day due date of Dec 1, and I left that alone. The tool reported only th\r\ne due date and reminder time as changed, so I haven't checked whether that field still shows Dec 1.\r\n"]
